      "title": "Mid-trial dosimetric analysis of the korean radiation oncology group 19 - 09 multi-institutional prospective cohort study on breast cancer",
      "summary": "A mid-trial dosimetric analysis revealed significant dose deviations in breast cancer radiotherapy, suggesting that current methods for assessing regional nodal irradiation (RNI) omission may be inadequate. Future analysis will focus on correlating specific nodal doses with long-term clinical outcomes.",
